292	- **`ant compileAll` deletes a tracked file** (reproduced at every gather). `compileAll` depends on `compileCommon` (`build.xml:539`), which depends on `cleanCache` (`:715`), which deletes `default_repository/caches` entire (`:42,356-359`) — including the tracked `global.map`, the linker's persisted `RepoState` (`linker/RepoState.java:176`). Every tree that runs `ant compileAll` therefore shows `D default_repository/caches/global.map` afterwards, and a `git add -A` at that moment commits the deletion; restore it with `git checkout -- default_repository/caches/global.map`.
